---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../data/site";

const updated = "2026-11-03";
---

<Base
  title={`Privacy · ${SITE.name}`}
  description="What Karakoa collects when you use this site or send a message, and how it is used."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 pb-20 sm:px-6">
    <header class="pb-8 pt-14 sm:pt-20">
      <p class="reveal eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="reveal d1 mt-4 text-title2 font-semibold text-ink xs:text-title1 sm:text-large">How we handle your details</h1>
      <p class="reveal d2 mt-3 text-footnote text-muted">Last updated {updated}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="reveal d2 prose">
      <p>
        This site sets no cookies of its own and loads no advertising or tracking scripts. Fonts and
        images are served from this domain.
      </p>

      <h2>The message form</h2>
      <p>
        When you send the form, the details you enter (your name, email, project type, and message) go to our
        server on Cloudflare, which emails them to our inbox. We use your details to reply to you and, if you go
        ahead with a project, to work with you. We do not sell or share them.
      </p>
      <p>
        To keep out spam, the form uses <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/application-services/products/turnstile/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Cloudflare Turnstile</a>,
        which loads only when you reach the form and checks your browser for signs of automation.
      </p>

      <h2>Direct channels</h2>
      <p>
        Email and Calendly links open those services. Each one has its own privacy policy
        that applies when you use it.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served by Cloudflare, which keeps standard request logs (such as IP address and
        request time) for security and performance, and measures page speed with its cookieless
        real user monitoring beacon. Neither identifies you to us, and we add no tracking of our own.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        Ask us to delete any message you sent and we will. Write to{" "}
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
